<section id="sphinx-page">
<h1>Sphinx add-ons <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#sphinx-page" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h1>
<p>This page uses the directives and roles of <code>sphinx-addons</code>. They work
in Markdown too: see <a href="../guide/myst.html">Directives in Markdown</a>.</p>
<span id="index-0"></span><div class="lsd-admonition" data-kind="versionadded">
<p class="lsd-admonition-title">Added in version 0.1</p>
<p>Pages can use Sphinx&#39;s directives.</p>
</div>
<lsd-copy><figure class="lsd-code" id="plugin-entry" data-language="toml" data-lines="3"><pre class="highlight"><code class="language-toml"><span class="hl-source hl-toml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-table hl-array hl-begin hl-toml">[[</span><span class="hl-meta hl-tag hl-table hl-array hl-toml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-table hl-toml">plugins</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-table hl-array hl-end hl-toml">]]</span>
<span class="hl-meta hl-tag hl-key hl-toml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-toml">name</span></span> <span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-key-value hl-toml">=</span> <span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-basic hl-toml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-toml">&quot;</span>sphinx<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-toml">&quot;</span></span>
<span class="hl-meta hl-tag hl-key hl-toml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-toml">builtin</span></span> <span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-key-value hl-toml">=</span> <span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-basic hl-toml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-toml">&quot;</span>sphinx-addons<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-toml">&quot;</span></span></span></code></pre><figcaption>Listing 1 A plugin entry</figcaption></figure></lsd-copy>
<p><a href="#plugin-entry">Listing 1</a> shows the entry. Press <kbd class="lsd-kbd">Ctrl+C</kbd> to stop
<strong>lsdocs serve</strong>, pick <span class="lsd-menuselection">File ‣ <span class="lsd-accelerator">S</span>ave</span>, and read
the <abbr class="lsd-abbr" title="table of contents">TOC</abbr>. Everything indexed is in the
<a href="../genindex.html">Index</a>.</p>
